WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.180
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.420
Listen to me, Playmaker!

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.660
That Ignis...  Humanity's future-

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.330
Playmaker!  Let's finish him.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.060
Battle!

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:20.560
Powercode Talker attacks 
Motor Worm Spreader Queen!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.820
Powercode Talker's additional effect!

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:30.240
I tribute Space Insulator that's next to 
its link to double Powercode Talker's ATK!

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.480
Break through!

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.210
Power Termination Smash!

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.920
Playmaker!

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:48.330
Due to your actions, 
humanity's future will be-

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.860
Humanity's future?

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:05.710
I run Across the universe

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.880
At the speed of light

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:10.750
Begin Loading

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:14.490
Open the door of dreams

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:18.060
VRAINS spreads

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.160
Believe in myself

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:24.700
VRAINS continues

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:30.010
The circuit draws the future

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:34.080
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.680
Access!

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:38.380
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:39.980
I'm now With the Wind

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:42.280
Link with my soul

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:45.050
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.790
Now Win the Race

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.630
Connected world

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:53.130
No matter when

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:56.500
Nothing is impossible

00:02:56.700 --> 00:03:00.640
Strive for hope

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:05.210
And ride the wind!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:28.720
My AI Duelist Squad purged the three 
Knights of Hanoi from LINK VRAINS.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.120
Well done, Kitamura.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:32.870
Thank you very much.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:37.140
But if something like this happens again-

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:39.080
You know the consequences.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:43.380
Don't worry.  I've already taken steps.

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:45.050
Please look at this.

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.780
I've already deployed them.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:53.330
The last Hanoi leftovers will be purged soon.

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:55.330
I see.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:04:02.410
I'll pursue the Ignis again and accomplish 
what Zaizen was too incompetent to do.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:04.030
I'm counting on you.

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:10.030
Today will be a great day 
for SOL Technologies.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.330
And I'll get my promotion.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:18.670
Kitamura!

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:21.960
What is it?

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.480
Say whatever you want.

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:27.240
The AI Duelist Squad is 
vanishing one after another!

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:30.660
What?

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:34.390
The sensors must be malfunctioning, right?

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.900
There are no malfunctions.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.540
The squad is being deleted!

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.620
Are you trying to delete my career?

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:46.360
The squad is vanishing all over LINK VRAINS!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.580
Expel the normal duelists!

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:52.240
We have no control over LINK VRAINS!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:57.100
My promotion is going away...

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:00.720
Thanks as usual.  Please come again.

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:03.250
This'll be my last time.

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:06.720
Oh.  Are you moving?

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.330
Something like that.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:13.930
I'm also at the public 
viewing plaza!  Come visit!

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:18.160
You lost another customer.

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:22.080
If you want to sell more, 
I'll be your mascot.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.640
That's a lame mascot.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.350
I'm lame?

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:29.490
Very lame.

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.310
Anyway, how's it going?

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.610
The remaining Knights of 
Hanoi have been eliminated.

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:37.620
Normal avatars have returned.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:40.690
Peace has returned to LINK VRAINS.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:43.390
Or it's the calm before the storm.

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:45.990
The only problem left is Revolver.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.130
Him?  But didn't he run away?

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:52.080
No.  Revolver isn't the type to run away.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:57.120
There must be a reason 
why he hasn't appeared.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:05.070
What is it?

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:08.380
Yusaku, you felt it too?

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:11.650
Yeah.  What was that weird feeling?

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.350
Did something happen?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.360
I felt something strange just now.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:19.360
Because he has Link Sense.

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:23.090
Kusanagi!  Let's thoroughly 
check LINK VRAINS!

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:28.520
Currently, LINK VRAINS is completely normal.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:32.940
Officially announced that 
the Knights of Hanoi left.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:35.940
You called just to tell me this?

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.940
But contrary to the official statement...

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:43.920
...each division asked for more 
operators and programmers.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:45.890
That means...

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.690
The Knights of Hanoi 
wouldn't retreat so easily.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:52.630
And Revolver is still in hiding.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.660
I see.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:07:00.240
Something is happening when 
nothing seems to be happening.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.840
The perfect time to find treasure.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.720
Is that the cyber treasure hunter's credo?

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:06.840
Exactly.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:12.580
If I acquire it, I'll let 
you have it.  For a price.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.680
You're only getting it thanks to my info.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:17.320
How about a discount?

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.890
We'll see.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.530
The die has been cast.

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:32.170
Losing these three is a serious blow.

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:38.660
I lost them because I was 
focused on Playmaker.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:42.620
But I have no time for sentimentality.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:46.850
They've become the foundation 
to fulfill our plan.

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:48.850
Yes, Revolver.

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:52.850
But we still don't know Playmaker's identity.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:54.430
Is that fine?

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:58.600
This plan must succeed, even 
if it costs me my life.

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:04.800
I'll eliminate anyone who 
interferes, no matter who!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.370
What's that?

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.290
What are you setting in LINK VRAINS?

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:21.850
I set the LVSS - LINK 
VRAINS Searching System

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:26.410
- so that I won't miss 
even the tiniest anomaly.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:32.420
I'll even know your current 
location in real time.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:40.170
I included other support functions, 
but they're about 80%.

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:45.020
They can't be fully used yet, 
but I'll finish it when I can.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:51.520
Sense something again?

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:57.540
What?

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:02.740
LINK VRAINS' infrastructure 
program may have been altered!

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.020
Going, Yusaku?

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:10.460
I have a bad feeling again.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:12.000
Let's not go!

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:16.370
Kusanagi, the course of events 
are different than before.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.460
Change the course of this conversation.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:23.680
#1: Revolver always acted in public, 
but he hasn't shown himself.

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:31.890
#2: I'm sensing that something 
will happen in LINK VRAINS.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.860
That's your Link Sense.

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:39.600
#3: If Revolver won't make 
a move, I'll track him down!

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.030
Deck set!  Into the VRAINS!

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.870
Everything seems normal.

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:30.860
A cyber treasure hunter has various 
tools for these situations.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:37.090
Everyone, let me know if 
you find any treasure.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.520
Go on.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.040
I'm counting on you.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.880
There's something weird going on.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:06.850
Seriously, I feel we're in danger.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:09.880
Let's go home!  It's dangerous!

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.660
We have to find the cause.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.520
But not today.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.240
Yusaku, what's going on?

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:24.090
That was really strong!

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:24.700
Yeah.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:26.300
Just “yeah?"

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:28.300
Let's return another time!

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:32.500
Something is happening in LINK VRAINS.

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:38.480
What are those?  Fireflies?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.540
Follow them!

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.820
Are they taking a break?

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:14.210
Or is something over there?

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:15.520
Hey!

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.190
Leave them alone.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:21.930
Oh.  You again.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.480
That's not a nice greeting.

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:28.990
I can say the same about you.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.860
Ghost Girl?

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:37.930
Why are you here?

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:39.040
That's right!

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:43.780
I received a tip that something's 
happening in LINK VRAINS.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.140
Tip?

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:49.750
Since you're here, that 
means it wasn't a false tip.

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:52.350
What are those fireflies?

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:55.840
They're guides in finding treasure.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:59.080
They find and tell me 
about interesting items.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:02.590
That program is unfair, just like you.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.560
No, they're reliable partners.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:07.320
Up ahead is dangerous.

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:09.560
You should log out.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:13.040
You're planning to steal my treasure.

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:18.240
They say the greater the danger, 
the greater the rewards.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:33.460
See you.

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:39.050
Let her investigate while we stay here.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:42.020
Ghost Girl and my goals are different.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.900
There's a sewer in LINK VRAINS?

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.540
For unnecessary data.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.000
You're well-informed.

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:57.580
Who do you think I am?

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:01.750
I'm a treasure hunter who 
explored many virtual worlds.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:06.540
It's flowing towards a 
data reprocessing plant.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:10.400
I know because I saw a lot on the run.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.310
It diverges in two.  What should we do?

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:19.370
Which way should we go?  Sheesh!

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.810
The fireflies went right.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:26.480
Find something?

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:30.050
Well, right or left.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:34.790
We have to split apart.  So which way?

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:38.020
Let's decide with a game.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:40.100
Good idea!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.390
That's why you're Playmaker's AI.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:47.630
I like receiving praise, 
but I have a name.  Ai.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.640
What a cute name.

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.900
Ai because you're an AI?

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:57.340
T-T-That's too simple a reason!

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:59.650
You're wrong.

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:06.720
How about whoever draws the lovelier card 
from my deck gets to choose the path?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:11.080
Fine!  I'm super confident 
in my drawing skills!

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:13.930
But maybe you're going to cheat.

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:18.160
Don't be silly.  What's 
the benefit of doing that?

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:21.870
So with this... And that...

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.440
Good enough?

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:32.180
Okay!  Here I go!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.420
My right arm is yearning to draw.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.270
It whispers to me that it wants a card.

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:45.060
Your deck will respond to this 
thirst, this feeling, this desire!

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:50.800
This is my special Destiny Draw!

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:01.420
Too bad!  This card isn't lovely at all!

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:03.150
You failed.

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:07.770
It's so bad that I don't even have to draw.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:11.900
I'll go right.  You go left.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:17.140
I can't believe I drew that card.

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:20.510
That deck was full of bad cards.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.850
She cheated?

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:27.120
Yeah.  Using the simplest trick.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:31.620
She tricked me.  For the third time.

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:36.020
But it doesn't make a difference 
in running into danger.

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:39.920
Our goal is to find the 
cause of the abnormalities.

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.120
Sorry, Playmaker.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:47.100
The treasure is this way.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.000
Did you see that?

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:14.850
Yeah.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.980
I think it went away.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:24.990
T-There it is!

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:47.130
I told you this was dangerous!

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:48.010
Be quiet!

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:54.400
The reprocessing plant?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.260
What's this?

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:15.650
This is the core of LINK 
VRAINS's reprocessing system?

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.850
What's that?

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:28.520
This is...

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.260
This is bad.  What's going on?

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:34.260
Everyone!  Gather the data!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.670
Good.  Keep it up.

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.870
They're all here.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.740
Good.  You're all wonderful.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.860
The shocks are getting stronger!

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:07.430
Is a great danger coming?

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:19.110
This amount of energy is crazy!

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:23.350
Lots of energy are entering 
the reprocessing system!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.560
Why?  What's happening?

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:47.570
Ghost Girl, I didn't expect to meet you here.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.340
Revolver.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:54.340
You're snooping again.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:57.960
No, I just got lost.

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:01.610
I'll leave right away.

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:03.550
Bye.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:12.260
Since you've seen this place, 
I can't let you leave.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.490
As expected!

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:23.140
It's pointless.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.580
What will you do after you capture me?

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.800
You want to leave that badly?

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:32.280
Because if I stay with you, 
I think I'm in trouble.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:37.250
You'll help me tune my deck.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:41.720
If you win the duel, I'll let you go.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:44.530
I see.  Not a bad offer.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.780
But I'll pass.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:05.620
I have to log out.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:10.620
You can't log out from this area.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:17.020
Ready to duel?

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:19.460
I guess I have to duel!

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:21.500
Speed Duel!

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:24.190
I go first!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:27.640
I summon Altergeist Marionetter!

00:21:29.240 --> 00:21:34.860
When she's successfully summoned, 
I can set one card from my deck!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:39.210
Then I set another card from my hand!

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:45.480
Faster!  Or it'll catch us!

00:22:07.650 --> 00:22:14.470
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:21.610
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:28.840
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:29.340 --> 00:22:36.190
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:43.430
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:47.590
There were fragments of power

00:22:47.820 --> 00:22:54.770
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:55.000 --> 00:23:02.110
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:09.290
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:16.520
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:23.370
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:31.070
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:41.630
Beyond the doorway to the abyss is 
the path of death and destruction.

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:45.640
Is there hope ahead?  You 
can't know unless you go.

00:23:46.280 --> 00:23:50.710
The only thing humanity 
can do is to keep moving.

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:54.460
Revolver pulls the final trigger.

00:23:54.460 --> 00:23:58.520
This abnormality is different 
than before.  Let's hurry!

00:23:58.520 --> 00:24:02.220
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
The Final Trigger

00:24:02.220 --> 00:24:04.120
Into the VRAINS!
